Automating a Subscription Billing System for SaaS, utility, or service-based companies enables seamless plan management, billing cycles, recurring payments, pro-rating, and reminders, all from a centralized backend.

🎯 Goal
Create a multi-tenant, automated subscription system that supports:

Multiple billing cycles (monthly, yearly, etc.)

Auto-renewals and expirations

Flexible plans and addons

Invoice generation and online payments

Email/WhatsApp/SMS reminders and alerts

🧩 Key Features
Category Functionality
🏢 Tenant Management Multiple companies (tenants), each with their own customers and plans
👤 Customer Management Customers with contact info, payment methods, history
💼 Plan Management Monthly/annual plans with trial period, addons, and pricing tiers
🔁 Subscription Engine Start, renew, cancel, and pause subscriptions
📆 Billing & Invoicing Auto-generate invoices based on billing cycle
💳 Payment Gateway Razorpay / Stripe / PhonePe integration
🔔 Notification System Renewal reminders, failed payments, invoice alerts
📈 Analytics Dashboard Revenue, churn, active vs inactive subscribers

🛠️ Tech Stack (Recommended)
Backend: Fastify (Node.js) + Prisma ORM + PostgreSQL

Queue & Scheduling: BullMQ + Redis for billing cycle and reminders

Frontend: Vue.js + TailwindCSS or Vuetify (Admin Panel + Customer Portal)

Payments: Razorpay, Stripe, PhonePe

Email/Alerting: Resend, Twilio, WhatsApp API

🧠 Core Data Models (Prisma)
ts
Copy
Edit
model Tenant {
id String @id @default(cuid())
name String
plans Plan[]
customers Customer[]
}

model Plan {
id String @id @default(cuid())
name String
price Float
billingCycle String // MONTHLY, YEARLY
trialDays Int?
tenantId String
}

model Customer {
id String @id @default(cuid())
name String
email String
phone String
tenantId String
subscriptions Subscription[]
}

model Subscription {
id String @id @default(cuid())
customerId String
planId String
status String // ACTIVE, CANCELED, TRIAL, EXPIRED
startDate DateTime
endDate DateTime
nextBillingDate DateTime
autoRenew Boolean @default(true)
lastInvoiceId String?
}

model Invoice {
id String @id @default(cuid())
subscriptionId String
amount Float
status String // PENDING, PAID, FAILED
dueDate DateTime
paidAt DateTime?
}
🔁 Automation Flow
🔄 1. Subscription Renewal Cron (Daily)
Fetch all subscriptions where nextBillingDate = today

Generate Invoice record

Trigger payment via Razorpay/Stripe

Update nextBillingDate to +1 month/year

📧 2. Reminder Notifications
7/3/1 days before nextBillingDate

Send Email/WhatsApp reminders

🧾 3. Invoice Generation
On new subscription or renewal

Auto PDF invoice or email invoice

Mark invoice PAID on webhook callback

💳 Razorpay Integration Flow
Create Razorpay payment link or order

Store razorpay_order_id in Invoice

On webhook payment.captured, update invoice to PAID

Trigger receipt and subscription extension

📈 Admin Dashboard Widgets
Widget Purpose
💰 Monthly Recurring Revenue Sum of active subscriptions this month
📉 Churn Rate Cancelled / total subscriptions
📈 Plan Breakdown Revenue per plan
⏳ Upcoming Renewals Subscriptions expiring in next 7 days

🧪 Optional Enhancements
Free trials with auto-conversion

Custom billing cycle support (weekly/quarterly)

Coupon code/discount handling

Pause/Resume subscriptions

Audit logs & payment retries

